    'Privacy Policy' => '',
    'How BrickAtlas handles personal data, cookies, analytics, ads and affiliate links.' => '',
    'contact form' => '',
    'Who we are' => '',
    'BrickAtlas.shop ("BrickAtlas", "we") is an independent LEGO® set catalogue and price comparison site. The data controller is {operator}. You can reach us through the {contact}.' => '',
    'What data we collect' => '',
    'Contact form: your name, email address and message. We use them only to reply to you and keep them no longer than needed to handle your request.' => '',
    'User account (optional): email address, username and the settings, reviews and lists you save. You can ask us to delete your account at any time.' => '',
    'Analytics: we use Google Analytics 4 to understand how the site is used (pages viewed, approximate location, device type). Google may set cookies for this purpose.' => '',
    'Advertising: some pages show ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to show and measure ads, including personalised ads where permitted. You can manage ad personalisation at adssettings.google.com.' => '',
    'Server logs: our hosting provider records technical data such as IP address, browser and requested URL to keep the service secure and working. Logs are kept for a limited time.' => '',
    'Cookies' => '',
    'We use essential cookies (session, security token, language choice) as well as analytics and advertising cookies from Google. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site works without analytics and advertising cookies.' => '',
    'Affiliate links' => '',
    'Some links to stores are affiliate links. When you click one and make a purchase, the store or affiliate network (for example Rakuten Advertising or Tradedoubler) may set its own cookie to attribute the sale, and we may earn a commission. This does not change the price you pay. The store\'s own privacy policy applies once you leave BrickAtlas.' => '',
    'Legal basis and sharing' => '',
    'Your rights' => '',
    'Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict processing of your data, to object to processing, and to data portability. To exercise these rights, contact us through the {contact}. You may also lodge a complaint with the Polish data protection authority (Prezes Urzędu Ochrony Danych Osobowych, uodo.gov.pl) or your local supervisory authority.' => '',
    'Changes' => '',
    'Last updated: {date}' => '',
    'No deals right now' => '',
    'We are adding offers from more stores, including Polish and European retailers. In the meantime, take a look at:' => '',
    'Sets retiring soon' => '',
    'Some product links are affiliate links. If you buy through one, we may earn a commission. You pay the same price.' => '',
    'We process data to answer your messages and run your account (performance of a service), and to keep the site working and secure (our legitimate interest). We do not sell personal data. We share it only with the providers we use: hosting (MyDevil, Poland), Google (analytics and ads) and, when you click an affiliate link, the store or network behind it.' => '',
    'We may update this policy when the site changes. The date at the top shows the current version.' => '',
    'Some store links on offer cards are affiliate links. When you buy through one, we may earn a small commission and you pay the same price. That is how we keep BrickAtlas free.' => '',
    'Pick a strong one. You won\'t need to type it often.' => '',
    'Thanks for your message. We\'ll get back to you soon.' => '',
    'Thanks for signing up. Check your inbox for a verification email. The link is valid for {hours} hours.' => '',
    'I own this set: add it to my collection' => '',
    'What this particular set is for you. You might buy one set for display and another for play, so we save these answers separately for each set.' => '',
    'No reviews yet. Be the first!' => '',
    'A homepage built around your collection: themes, new arrivals and price drops, updated along with the catalog.' => '',
    'A few quick questions about budget, age and theme, and we\'ll match sets for you.' => '',
    'Small bonus builds that come with collectible LEGO magazines: minifigure packs, vehicles and seasonal scenes from newsstand issues.' => '',
    'Sets sold only through official LEGO channels. They are usually larger collector releases and sell out fast.' => '',
    'Sets with a confirmed retirement date. Once they leave stores, prices usually go up.' => '',
    'Snowy builds, holiday scenes and sets that make good gifts.' => '',
    'Search (try "AFOL" or "sealed box")' => '',
    'A change to an official set, such as added details, a bigger baseplate or remixed parts.' => '',
    'The smaller cousin of BURP: a one-piece rock mold for compact scenes.' => '',
    'Praise for using a part in a clever, unexpected way, like a wrench as a moustache or a flame as a fish tail.' => '',
    'An online LEGO marketplace and inventory tool, smaller than BrickLink.' => '',
    'Tag for a MOC that is still being built or refined. Feedback welcome.' => '',
    'LEGO sets grouped by interest: Adults Welcome, Star Wars, Magazines, Polybags, Exclusive, Harry Potter and more.' => '',
    'Shortcuts into the catalog. Pick what you\'re into and we\'ll show matching sets.' => '',
    'Heartlake City sets: cafés, pets and friendship stories.' => '',
    'Answers to common questions about BrickAtlas: prices, wishlist, reviews, account and privacy.' => '',
    'Quick answers about prices, your wishlist, reviews and your account. Type a keyword to filter or browse by topic.' => '',
    'Search the FAQ (try "wishlist", "price" or "password")' => '',
    '"On Sale" lists sets where the lowest store offer we found is below the official LEGO price. The biggest discounts are at the top.' => '',
    'No. The price shown is the item price listed by the store. Shipping, taxes and coupons are calculated at the store\'s checkout, so check the final price before you order.' => '',
    'Click "Register" in the top bar, fill in your username, email and password, and submit. We\'ll email you a link that is valid for 24 hours. Click it to activate your account.' => '',
    'I didn\'t receive the verification email. What now?' => '',
    'Check your spam folder first. If it\'s not there, use the "Resend verification" link on the sign-in page and we\'ll send a new link to the same address.' => '',
    'Use the flag selector in the top bar to switch languages on any page. If you\'re signed in, you can also save a preferred language in Settings and we\'ll use it on all your devices.' => '',
    'Yes. Turn on "Hide sets I already own" in Settings. Sets you marked as owned will no longer appear in the main catalog, search or new arrivals.' => '',
    'No. Your wishlist and owned sets are private. We use them only for your personal homepage and recommendations.' => '',
    'Quick rating is one overall score (0–10) plus an optional one-line note, about 30 seconds. Detailed reviews score 6 dimensions (Look, Build, Features, Quality, Value, Overall) and feed the radar chart on the set page.' => '',
    'Yes. We use cookies for sign-in sessions, your language preference, analytics (Google Analytics) and ads (Google AdSense). Details are in our Privacy Policy.' => '',
